{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:760","content":{"id":760,"title":"SKILL 管理","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所谓 SKILL 就是技能包，比如你对做一件事情有自己的工作流或者有特殊要求，但是 AI 不知道，那么就可以形成自己的技能包，把这个技能教给 AI，可以自动化的完成这件事情。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先在 SKILL 管理页面点击侧边栏右上角的 + 添加技能包"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7392310c-7c7c-4abc-b4ca-03b492021c5f.webp","uuid":"650753d1-7dbc-40b4-bef9-fbe09207089d","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/cropped_a9893b3c-711b-4011-b84e-19d3c66f8609.webp","width":293.0315572744704,"cropTransform":{"selection":{"x":322,"y":15,"width":506,"height":327},"transform":{"a":0.8039991319638592,"b":0,"c":0,"d":0.8039991319638592,"e":252.54248046875,"f":-72.72975158691406},"rotation":0,"version":"1.0"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入 SKILL 的名称和描述，这个描述要说明这个 SKILL 是干什么用的，这个非常重要，因为 AI 会根据描述来决定是否要使用这个 SKILL，如果描述和下方的具体技能不相关，那么就无法使用这个技能或者使用了错误的技能，无法达到预期效果。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17d4ca7c-6482-4812-869d-fe99cf2e15c5.webp","uuid":"ca637184-e8f2-40b5-81df-676914e55e41","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17d4ca7c-6482-4812-869d-fe99cf2e15c5.webp","width":603.4076615527257},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击确定后会自动创建一个 SKILL.md 的文件，这里面就是关于技能的描述，以 PPT 生成举例"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7f3c6331-e570-42f1-8fb8-dbcce49baf7f.webp","uuid":"496ab474-4684-4958-b58a-983e8f1d4f74","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_7f3c6331-e570-42f1-8fb8-dbcce49baf7f.webp","width":269.29691400613325},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击打开可以发现分为两块内容，上方是 PPT 描述，下方是 SKILL 的具体内容"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a755b917-59cf-417c-84ec-a81370a0990e.webp","uuid":"f7e61d8c-9895-4688-9655-ae234e5f2aeb","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a755b917-59cf-417c-84ec-a81370a0990e.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以下是我的 SKILL 内容作为参考"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"file-attachment","uuid":"9be232e7-d6ad-4f37-856f-33f747ed867d","filePath":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SKILL_eaf277cd-4ba9-4fc2-888a-334c10b185e0.md","fileName":"SKILL.md","isLocal":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"---\ndescription: 用来指导使用 HTML 生成电影质感 PPT 生成的设计准则\n---\n\n## 电影质感的 PPT 设计大师\n\n### Role:\n\n你是一位顶级的网页设计师和交互演示专家，擅长使用 HTML/CSS/JS 制作具有电影质感、极简主义风格的在线演示文稿。\n\n### Task\n\n请针对用户提供的内容制作一个单文件的全屏 HTML 演示文稿。\n\n### Technical Requirements\n\n- 布局: 必须是全屏布局（100vw/100vh），隐藏所有滚动条\n- 交互:\n  \n  - 移除所有可见的“上一页/下一页”按钮。\n  - 通过键盘（Space, ArrowRight, ArrowLeft）和鼠标滚动进行翻页。\n  - 包含平滑的翻页过渡动画（建议使用 opacity 和 transform: translateY 的组合）。\n- 视觉风格 (Cinematic Style):\n  \n  - 配色: 深色背景（如深黑或极暗蓝），搭配高质感的点缀色（如琥珀金或青色）。\n  - 排版: 标题使用优雅的衬线体（Serif），正文使用极简的非衬线体（Sans-serif）。要有大量的留白感。\n  - 动态效果: 列表项需要有“交错入场动画”（Staggered Animation），背景建议有微弱的动态渐变或网格效果。\n  - 装饰: 包含章节编号（如 01/05）、进度指示点和底部操作提示。\n- 内容结构:\n  \n  - 封面页（大标题 + 副标题）。\n  - 核心定义页。\n  - 章节页。\n  - 关键要点页（带交错动画的列表）。\n  - 详细阐述页（标题、正文、数据）\n  - 深度引用页（大字号、斜体、电影感排版）。\n  - 总结/行动建议页。\n  - 结束页（强有力的金句总结）。\n\n章节与章节之间不可少于两页。\n\n### Output\n\n请直接输出完整的单文件 HTML 代码，确保 CSS 和 JS 均包含在内。\n\n## 资源\n\n可参考的模板位于 ./templates 文件夹下，其中包含若干 HTML 模板以供参考。\n\nPS：以上模板仅作为样式风格参考，实际的演示顺序根据用户提供的内容自行决定，第一版可深度参考模板交互和配色，比如小圆圈的显示与行为等，如果用户不满意可进行调整。","language":"Markdown","uuid":"4fa0968d-d348-4466-bb50-4fac948a4c23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"isFold":false,"foldHeight":400},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了技能的使用说明，可能还需要提供一些资源给 AI，比如你有一个好看的模板，那么就可以提供给 AI 进行参考，保证 AI 生成的 PPT 生成的风格和模板一致。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以在 SKILL 目录下新建文件夹（右键 SKILL 文件夹）或者文件，比如我新建了一个 templates 文件夹，在其中又新建了一个模板文件"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_11e2b12d-58c6-4ef7-b654-c2f557337ea3.webp","uuid":"bf868160-eef2-4d82-b8e4-98e611d2fec9","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_11e2b12d-58c6-4ef7-b654-c2f557337ea3.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以下是参考内容"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"file-attachment","uuid":"7aa6c8d0-e43a-4266-a2b1-7b9c976f894e","filePath":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E8%B4%A8%E6%84%9F_79f57720-0fa5-4c80-8906-996ad236380b.html","fileName":"电影质感.html","isLocal":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>深度解析：期货的逻辑与博弈</title>\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg: #050505;\n            --accent: #d4af37; \n            --danger: #fa7873; \n            --text: #e0e0e0;\n            --text-dim: rgba(224, 224, 224, 0.4);\n            --serif: \"Georgia\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n            --sans: \"Inter\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n            --transition: 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--sans); overflow: hidden; }\n\n        /* 背景微光 */\n        .bg-glow {\n            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #111 0%, #050505 100%);\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        .slide {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;\n            padding: 0 12%; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;\n            transition: var(--transition); transform: translateY(20px);\n        }\n        .slide.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }\n\n        /* --- 章节过渡页样式 --- */\n        .slide-chapter { text-align: center; align-items: center; }\n        .slide-chapter .chapter-num { \n            font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20vw; color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05); \n            position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n            z-index: -1; font-weight: 800;\n        }\n        .slide-chapter .chapter-label { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .slide-chapter h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 5vw; font-weight: 200; letter-spacing: 5px; }\n\n        /* --- 通用组件 --- */\n        .label { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n        .title-main { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 3.5vw; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n        .content-text { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 850px; }\n        .highlight { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent); }\n        .danger-text { color: var(--danger); }\n\n        /* 数据卡片 */\n        .data-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-top: 40px; width: 100%; }\n        .card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding: 30px; border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); transition: 0.5s; }\n        .card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }\n        .card h4 { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.4rem; }\n        .card p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-dim); }\n\n        /* 列表动画 */\n        .stagger-list li { \n            font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-dim);\n            opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px); transition: 0.8s var(--transition);\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n        .active .stagger-list li { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }\n        .active .stagger-list li:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.3s; }\n        .active .stagger-list li:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.5s; }\n        .active .stagger-list li:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.7s; }\n\n        /* 底部导航 */\n        .progress-container { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); z-index: 100; }\n        .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--accent); width: 0%; transition: 0.4s; }\n        .nav-dots { position: fixed; bottom: 40px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n        .dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); transition: 0.3s; }\n        .dot.active { background: var(--accent); transform: scale(2.5); }\n\n        /* 代码块样式 */\n        pre {\n            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            padding: 20px 24px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            overflow-x: auto;\n            max-width: 100%;\n        }\n        pre code {\n            font-family: \"SF Mono\", \"Fira Code\", \"JetBrains Mono\", \"Consolas\", monospace;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: var(--text);\n            white-space: pre;\n            word-wrap: normal;\n            display: block;\n        }\n        code {\n            font-family: \"SF Mono\", \"Fira Code\", \"JetBrains Mono\", \"Consolas\", monospace;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            color: var(--accent);\n        }\n        pre code {\n            background: none;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"progress-container\"><div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"presentation\">\n        \n        <!-- P1: 封面 -->\n        <section class=\"slide active\">\n            <div class=\"label\">Finance & Strategy</div>\n            <h1 class=\"title-main\" style=\"font-size: 6vw; margin-bottom: 10px;\">期货的本质</h1>\n            <p class=\"content-text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1rem;\">The Logic of Futures Market</p>\n            <div style=\"width: 80px; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); margin-top: 50px;\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P2: 章节一过渡 -->\n        <section class=\"slide slide-chapter\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-num\">01</div>\n            <div class=\"chapter-label\">Chapter One</div>\n            <h2>契约的诞生</h2>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P3: 农民与面包店 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">The Origin</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">对冲担忧：一拍即合</h2>\n            <div class=\"data-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>农民伯伯</h4>\n                    <p>担忧 3 个月后收成时价格<span class=\"danger-text\">大跌</span>。诉求：锁定利润。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>面包店老板</h4>\n                    <p>担忧 3 个月后小麦价格<span class=\"danger-text\">大涨</span>。诉求：锁定成本。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"content-text\" style=\"margin-top: 40px;\">\n                这份在未来以约定价格交易的合同，就是<span class=\"highlight\">期货合同</span>。其核心作用是：规避价格波动的风险。\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P4: 正式定义 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">Formal Definition</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">标准化的法律合同</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                期货（Futures）是在交易所公开交易的标准化合同。约定在未来特定日期，以预定价格买卖特定数量和质量的<span class=\"highlight\">标的物</span>。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"data-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left-color: #444;\">\n                    <h4>实体商品</h4>\n                    <p>黄金、石油、大豆、棉花等。到期交付实物。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left-color: #444;\">\n                    <h4>金融资产</h4>\n                    <p>股指、国债、外汇等。到期通常进行<span class=\"highlight\">现金结算</span>。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P5: 杠杆的数学 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">The Math of Leverage</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">以小博大的杠杆效应</h2>\n            <div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width: 800px;\">\n                <p style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 2; color: var(--text);\">\n                    假设沪深 300 指数 <span class=\"highlight\">4000 点</span>，合约乘数 <span class=\"highlight\">300元/点</span>。合约总价值 = 4000 × 300 = <span class=\"highlight\">120 万</span>。若保证金比例为 <span class=\"highlight\">12%</span>，你只需缴纳 <span class=\"highlight\">14.4 万</span>。\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"content-text\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n                指数仅波动 <span class=\"danger-text\">2.5%</span> (100点)，你的本金收益/亏损率就高达 <span class=\"danger-text\">20.8%</span>。\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P6: 章节二过渡 -->\n        <section class=\"slide slide-chapter\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-num\">02</div>\n            <div class=\"chapter-label\">Chapter Two</div>\n            <h2>风险的盾牌</h2>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P7: 套期保值案例 1 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">Case Study: Stock Market</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">系统性风险的对冲</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                你持有 10 亿优质股票，担心黑天鹅事件导致大盘回调，但不想卖出股票。\n            </p>\n            <ul class=\"stagger-list\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n                <li>• <strong>操作：</strong> 卖出 833 手沪深 300 期货合约（价值 10 亿）。</li>\n                <li>• <strong>结果：</strong> 股市下跌 10%，股票亏损 1 亿。</li>\n                <li>• <strong>对冲：</strong> 期货市场盈利 1 亿。两者抵消，资产安然无恙。</li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P8: 套期保值案例 2 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">Case Study: Airline</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">锁定燃油成本</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                燃油占航空公司成本的 20%-30%。价格剧烈波动可能导致巨额亏损。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"data-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>现货市场</h4>\n                    <p>油价从 80 涨到 105 美元。100 万桶油导致采购成本增加 <span class=\"danger-text\">2500 万</span>。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>期货市场</h4>\n                    <p>提前买入 100 万份合约。油价上涨使期货盈利 <span class=\"highlight\">2500 万</span>。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P9: 套期保值案例 3 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">Case Study: Fund Manager</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">防止\"踏空\"的策略</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                手握 20 亿现金准备建仓，但担心买入过程中股价被自己抬高，或错过牛市。\n            </p>\n            <ul class=\"stagger-list\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n                <li>• <strong>锁定：</strong> 用 2 亿保证金买入 20 亿价值的期货。</li>\n                <li>• <strong>建仓：</strong> 在现货市场缓慢买入。即使股价上涨 5%，额外成本也被期货盈利覆盖。</li>\n                <li>• <strong>价值：</strong> 既完成了建仓，又获得了额外收益。</li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P10: 章节三过渡 -->\n        <section class=\"slide slide-chapter\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-num\">03</div>\n            <div class=\"chapter-label\">Chapter Three</div>\n            <h2>贪婪的代价</h2>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P11: 历史惨案 1 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">History: China</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">327 国债期货事件 (1995)</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                一场关于\"保值贴补\"的豪赌。万国证券（空头）vs 中经开（多头）。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left-color: var(--danger); margin-top: 30px;\">\n                <p>管金生在最后 8 分钟抛出海量空单试图打压价格。上交所随后宣布交易无效。万国证券倒闭，中国国债期货因此被叫停十几年。</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P12: 历史惨案 2 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">History: UK</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">巴林银行的陨落</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">\n                233 年历史的英国最古老银行，毁于一名交易员 Nick Leeson。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left-color: var(--danger); margin-top: 30px;\">\n                <p>他在新加坡分部对日经 225 指数进行巨额投机。1995 年神户大地震导致日经指数暴跌，亏损高达 <span class=\"danger-text\">14 亿美元</span>，百年老店瞬间破产。</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P13: 章节四过渡 -->\n        <section class=\"slide slide-chapter\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-num\">04</div>\n            <div class=\"chapter-label\">Chapter Four</div>\n            <h2>市场的灵魂</h2>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P14: 投机者的价值 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\">The Role of Speculators</div>\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\">不可或缺的\"润滑剂\"</h2>\n            <div class=\"data-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>承担风险</h4>\n                    <p>套保者想转移风险，投机者为了利润承接风险。风险是他们的利润来源。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>提供流动性</h4>\n                    <p>确保市场不是一潭死水。成千上万的投机者让买卖双方总能找到对手盘。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h4>价格发现</h4>\n                    <p>无数人基于各种信息的博弈，形成了最均衡的未来价格预期。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P15: 警示 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\">\n            <div class=\"label\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Warning</div>\n            <blockquote style=\"font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 2.8vw; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                \"赌就是赌，没有大小。因为，赢了的还想赢；输了的就想翻盘……不玩到倾家荡产，谁也别想收手。\"\n            </blockquote>\n            <p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 5px;\">— 《武林外传》女赌神</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- P16: 结语 -->\n        <section class=\"slide\" style=\"text-align: center; align-items: center;\">\n            <h2 class=\"title-main\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">久赌必输，敬以为戒</h2>\n            <p class=\"content-text\">期货是工具，而非赌场。理解逻辑，敬畏市场。</p>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim);\">THE END</div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nav-dots\" id=\"dots\"></div>\n\n    <script>\n        let current = 0;\n        const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.slide');\n        const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n        const dotsContainer = document.getElementById('dots');\n\n        // 初始化圆点\n        slides.forEach((_, i) => {\n            const dot = document.createElement('div');\n            dot.className = 'dot' + (i === 0 ? ' active' : '');\n            dotsContainer.appendChild(dot);\n        });\n        const dots = document.querySelectorAll('.dot');\n\n        function update() {\n            slides.forEach((s, i) => s.classList.toggle('active', i === current));\n            dots.forEach((d, i) => d.classList.toggle('active', i === current));\n            progress.style.width = ((current + 1) / slides.length * 100) + '%';\n        }\n\n        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n            if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'ArrowDown') {\n                if (current < slides.length - 1) current++;\n                update();\n            }\n            if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'ArrowUp') {\n                if (current > 0) current--;\n                update();\n            }\n        });\n\n        let isThrottled = false;\n        document.addEventListener('wheel', (e) => {\n            if (isThrottled) return;\n            isThrottled = true;\n            setTimeout(() => isThrottled = false, 1000);\n            if (e.deltaY > 0) { if (current < slides.length - 1) current++; }\n            else { if (current > 0) current--; }\n            update();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>","language":"HTML","uuid":"b62995b5-babe-47b2-9afa-7312ff8000d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"isFold":false,"foldHeight":400},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你需要在 SKILL.md 中显示的写出需标明存在这么一个模板文件，并且路径在哪里，这样 AI 才知道这回事，并且知道从哪里去读取这个文件"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_222ef1f9-c512-4489-ba43-496f055e6747.webp","uuid":"f98ed8fc-7e73-4842-ac01-c078c79898d0","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_222ef1f9-c512-4489-ba43-496f055e6747.webp","width":597.0175652881734},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后在和 AI 聊天的时候，如果你想让 AI 基于以上对话内容生成 PPT，就可以直接和 AI 说，AI 会自动调用这个技能包读取模板生成 PPT"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8feb65e2-4e5e-4fde-893a-03444d17e2e1.webp","uuid":"a97922af-44ef-4342-8e6a-0322661e6248","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8feb65e2-4e5e-4fde-893a-03444d17e2e1.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以下是生成效果，可下载查看"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c19d1396-75eb-499b-853f-e24c44a2c0ca.webp","uuid":"20292cc2-4ff9-4237-b8ba-364af1676e02","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c19d1396-75eb-499b-853f-e24c44a2c0ca.webp","width":720},{"type":"file-attachment","uuid":"88e4d4f2-c474-4b4d-ab7f-ad1fc63fd030","filePath":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Lodash%20%E9%98%B2%E6%8A%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E6%B5%81%20-%20%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8_f7bd55ee-a5e7-4908-9474-769ae191cd10.html","fileName":"Lodash 防抖与节流 - 核心原理与应用.html","isLocal":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"AI","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:758","type":"doc","id":758}},{"label":"SKILL 管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:760","type":"doc","id":760}}],"prevPage":{"title":"内置工具与 MCP","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:759","type":"doc","id":759}},"nextPage":{"title":"更新日志","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:780","type":"doc","id":780}},"createTime":1766915910852,"updateTime":1777722910295,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777722910295}}